                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6227: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mayer</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-05-30T10:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 30, 1925—10
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 30—1:12 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>194. My 189, May 26, 6 p.m. Chang Tso-lin arrived Tientsin 2 a.m. today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mayer</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
